UsageMaxx
=========

UsageMaxx is an unofficial Windows port of OpenUsage
(https://github.com/robinebers/openusage). It is not affiliated with, endorsed by,
or an official part of OpenUsage.

Provider behavior — credential locations, API endpoints, request headers, response
fields, and the metric vocabulary — was learned from OpenUsage's source code and
documentation and reimplemented in TypeScript. OpenUsage is distributed under the
